---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Security">
  <h1>Security boundaries</h1>
  <p>
    No reviewed release is available. Tests and restrictive browser policies do
    not establish a cryptographic proof or audit.
  </p>
  <p>
    A malicious host can replace delivered JavaScript. Before sensitive use,
    verify a pinned local sender through an independently trusted channel. A
    same-site hash or badge does not establish trust.
  </p>
  <p>
    RSA provides neither forward secrecy nor post-quantum security. Browser
    strings, extensions, operating systems and exported files remain outside
    guaranteed erasure.
  </p>
</Layout>
